            "notes": "[Tethered Tourniquet](item_9ac02f9a-7c06-46a3-94d4-2ba9a9cf623f) Time :D\n\nSince you have  [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) , this power will attach to TWO allies when you swap to your blaster\n\n- Now you can heal + DPS **simultaneously** when using your pistol at *any given moment*\n- Spam choke points for extra ult charge + pressure\n- If you want to min-max, **swap to your blaster before rezzing as well!** \n\nKeep in mind you don't have to wait the full 10 seconds to swap, just be aware of when the **timer runs out**. *You should charge it up to 10 before valking tho* \n\n##DONT be afraid to swap back to your staff if the beams aren't targeting the right person/you're out of position\n\n---- \n\nITEMS: \n- Buy Weapon Power + Attack Speed \n- If you have EXTRA cash take  [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145) \n- If you think you'll target their tank a lot take  [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) \n-  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) Armor is essential for survival - you will find yourself in the open more often",
