            "notes": "Same notes as last round, just upgrade your items as much as you can! \n\nTry to keep  [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) and [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) somewhat even to maximize healing output \n\n*WP increases heals per second, AS increases the rate of heals per second*\n\n---- \n\nITEMS: \n\nBuy [Celestial Clip](item_f9251c1f-5d38-4dd3-9365-8accca4b009b) - If you can afford to swap with [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) - The extra shot goes a long way!\n\n[Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)  - If your team needs more heals this is always a go-to\n\n\nIMPORTANT: [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) - Favorite survival item has saved me many times trying to DPS out of position and dealing with flankers.",
