            "notes": "[Battle Medic](item_ccd0edff-4d57-4ac2-83a7-bab6ff0ffb2f) \n\nThis is when the build shines.\n\nYou will see both  [Tethered Tourniquet](item_9ac02f9a-7c06-46a3-94d4-2ba9a9cf623f) and  [Battle Medic](item_ccd0edff-4d57-4ac2-83a7-bab6ff0ffb2f) have a 10-second charge. However, Battle Medic goes away when you **reload** therefore,  [Celestial Clip](item_f9251c1f-5d38-4dd3-9365-8accca4b009b) will be your bestfriend. \n\nSince you are building WP and AS your heals and DPS output will feel much more impactful!\n\n**Blaster squishes when you can, especially in Valk**\n\n---- \n\nYou can *shred shields and armor* (Ex: Winton bubble/Rein Shield/Brig/Orisa/DVA) \nOpt for [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) and  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if their tank is a problem or most of their team has armor \n\nEven if you don't hit all of your shots, you will rack up more assists and kills which = cash",
